#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-gps-based-antenna-tracking.rst:5
#: 43ec6e589bff4f6198d054b404a8310c
msgid "Mission Planner GPS-based Antenna Tracking"
msgstr "Mission Planner GPS 天线追踪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-gps-based-antenna-tracking.rst:7
#: 36d585f775d54118bcd60fa7ea3e6c01
msgid ""
"This article explains how to build a GPS-based :ref:`Antenna Tracker "
"<common-antenna-tracking>` that uses the :ref:`Mission Planner "
"<planner:install-mission-planner>` GCS to provide directional/tracking "
"information for a servo-driven directional antenna."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何构建基于 GPS 的 :ref:`天线追踪器 <common-antenna-tracking>`，该追踪器使用 :ref:`Mission"
" Planner <planner:install-mission-planner>` 地面站为舵机驱动的定向天线提供方向/追踪信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-gps-based-antenna-tracking.rst:12
#: 8730f0c74f204b159398038f7a6eb4ac
msgid ""
"This approach requires that the GCS is running on a PC that has access to "
"GPS information. See :ref:`Antenna Tracking <common-antenna-tracking>` for "
"other options."
msgstr ""
"此方案要求地面站运行在可访问 GPS 信息的 PC 上。请参阅 :ref:`天线追踪 <common-antenna-tracking>` "
"了解其他选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-gps-based-antenna-tracking.rst:16
#: 607e511995bc4971b1c49ec0e4e7b4ca
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-gps-based-antenna-tracking.rst:18
#: 56202cfe141c429bb9e957b7f99960c6
msgid ""
"An *Antenna Tracker* is a system that tracks the location of a vehicle and "
"uses this information to aim a directional antenna."
msgstr "*天线追踪器* 是一种追踪飞行器位置并利用该信息来瞄准定向天线的系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-gps-based-antenna-tracking.rst:21
#: 8539c118491047b2b7ff8bd28ce0d484
msgid ""
"The tracker described in this article uses the Mission Planner to determine "
"the direction to aim the tracker using the position of the GCS and the "
"current position information from the vehicle. The tracker requires that "
"your vehicle is providing GPS telemetry, and you will also need a Servo "
"Controller card in order to drive the servos from Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"本文描述的追踪器使用 Mission Planner，根据地面站的位置和飞行器当前位置信息来确定追踪器的瞄准方向。追踪器要求飞行器提供 GPS "
"数传数据，同时还需要舵机控制卡才能从 Mission Planner 驱动舵机。"

